The [original incident page](/kb/incidents/4471/) calls this one known issue with one fix queued.
Its rendered evidence separates a shared parser defect from a booking-form hint defect.
Track and verify those fixes independently.

<Callout>
This review covers the support KB export dated 4 October 2026. The desk continues to work.
These are snapshot findings, not a claim about the current queue or release status.
</Callout>

## Count reports once, then classify by tenant

<ExportSummary />

The table runs the supplied classification logic. It uses the tenant's locale, booking-form
version and report channel. Browser locale and intake tags are intake guesses; they do not
determine the cause. Each report stays in exactly one group.

